H4290\"in|strong=\"H5921\",  \nbut|strong=\"H3588\"it|strong=\"H5921\"is|strong=\"H5315\"because|strong=\"H3588\"of|strong=\"H5921\"all|strong=\"H3605\"these|strong=\"H3605\"things|strong=\"H3605\".   \n"},{"number":35,"text":"“Yet|strong=\"H3588\"you|strong=\"H3588\"said, ‘I|strong=\"H3588\"am|strong=\"H2005\"innocent|strong=\"H5352\".  \nSurely|strong=\"H3588\"his|strong=\"H7725\"anger has|strong=\"H3588\"turned|strong=\"H7725\"away|strong=\"H7725\"from|strong=\"H4480\"me|strong=\"H7725\".’  \n“Behold|strong=\"H2005\", I|strong=\"H3588\"will|strong=\"H3808\"judge|strong=\"H8199\"you|strong=\"H3588\",  \nbecause|strong=\"H3588\"you|strong=\"H3588\"say|strong=\"H7725\", ‘I|strong=\"H3588\"have|strong=\"H3588\"not|strong=\"H3808\"sinned|strong=\"H2398\".’   \n"},{"number":36,"text":"Why|strong=\"H4100\"do|strong=\"H4100\"you|strong=\"H4100\"go about|strong=\"H1870\"so|strong=\"H1571\"much|strong=\"H3966\"to|strong=\"H4714\"change|strong=\"H8138\"your|strong=\"H1571\"ways|strong=\"H1870\"?  \nYou|strong=\"H4100\"will|strong=\"H1571\"be|strong=\"H1571\"ashamed of|strong=\"H1870\"Egypt|strong=\"H4714\"also|strong=\"H1571\",  \nas|strong=\"H1571\"you|strong=\"H4100\"were|strong=\"H4714\"ashamed of|strong=\"H1870\"Assyria.   \n"},{"number":37,"text":"You|strong=\"H3588\"will|strong=\"H3068\"also|strong=\"H1571\"leave|strong=\"H3318\"that|strong=\"H3588\"place|strong=\"H3027\"with|strong=\"H3068\"your|strong=\"H3068\"hands|strong=\"H3027\"on|strong=\"H5921\"your|strong=\"H3068\"head|strong=\"H7218\";  \nfor|strong=\"H3588\"the|strong=\"H5921\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"has|strong=\"H3068\"rejected|strong=\"H3988\"those|strong=\"H5921\"in|strong=\"H5921\"whom|strong=\"H4009\"you|strong=\"H3588\"trust|strong=\"H4009\",  \nand|strong=\"H3068\"you|strong=\"H3588\"won’t prosper|strong=\"H6743\"with|strong=\"H3068\"them|strong=\"H5921\".   \n"}]}
